{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ robespierre \"louis xvi\" \"threat to the revolution\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_227304739#4_605190830","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2620","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_227304739#4_605190830\" , \"end_char\": 2178.000000 , \"headings\": \" \" , \"segment\": \"Who killed Louis XVI? <cover>Robespierre killed Louis XVI and he died by the guillotine Jean- Paul Marat helped too. Charles Henri Sanson however was the actual Royal Executioner. What year was King Louis XVI killed? On 21 January 1793. Why was Louis XVI's death significant? When King Louis XVI was killed, it officially ended the absolute monarchy in France. Who got killed by the guillotine? lots of people such as Marie Antionette and King Louis XVI Why was Louis XVI of France killed? A dead monarch was considered to be less of a threat to the Revolution.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 1623.000000 , \"title\": \"\" , \"url\": \"http://www.answers.com/Q/Why_was_Louis_XVI_killed\" }"}}
