{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ robespierre \"king must die\" \"country can live\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_893228277#1_1959396328","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2626","rank":1,"snippet":"Maximilien Robespierre >   Quotes Maximilien Robespierre quotes Showing 1-30 of 33 \" , \"segment\": \"to forgive them is cruelty.” ― Maximilien de Robespierre tags: forgiveness , opression , punishment 44 likes Like “Peoples do not judge in the same way as courts of law; they do not hand down sentences, they throw thunderbolts; they do not condemn kings, they drop them back into the void; and this justice is worth just as much as that of the courts.” ― Maximilien Robespierre tags: divine-violence , french-revolution , robespierre , violence , walter-benjamin 39 likes Like “The <cover>king must die so that the country can live.” ― Maximilien de Robespierre</cover>30 likes Like “A true revolutionary should be ready to perish in the process” ― Maximilien Robespierre 23 likes Like “A sensibility that wails almost exclusively over the enemies of liberty seems suspect to me. Stop shaking the tyrant's bloody robe in my face, or I will believe that you wish to put Rome in chains.”\" , \"start_char\": 492.000000 , \"title\": \"Maximilien Robespierre Quotes (Author of Virtue and Terror)\" , \"url\": \"https://www.goodreads.com/author/quotes/"}}
